OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAAirport owner killed in Swiss Alps
OL,4,Aplane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHall died when the Cirrus SR22T he was
OL,7,Ftravelling in crashed high in the
OL,8,Fmountains near the town of Leukerbad in
OL,9,Fthe southern canton of Valais on 15
OL,10,FSeptember.
OL,12,FIn a statement, his family said they
OL,13,Fwere "completely heartbroken by the
OL,14,Floss of a truly wonderful husband,
OL,15,Fdevoted father and much-loved man".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
